# XDK Java SDK

Official Java SDK for the X API v2 (Java 17+).

## Installation

### Maven

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>com.xdevplatform</groupId>
    <artifactId>xdk</artifactId>
    <version>{{ version }}</version>
</dependency>
```

## Quick Start

```java
import com.xdevplatform.xdk.XClient;
import com.xdevplatform.xdk.XClientConfig;
import com.xdevplatform.xdk.models.Schemas;

XClient client = XClient.builder()
    .bearerToken(System.getenv("X_BEARER_TOKEN"))
    .build();

Schemas.Get2UsersByUsernameUsernameResponse user =
    client.users().getByUsername("XDevelopers");
System.out.println(user.getData());
```

## Authentication

- **Bearer Token (App-Only)**: `XClient.builder().bearerToken("...").build()`
- **OAuth 2.0 User Context & PKCE**: `OAuth2Pkce` + `XClient.builder().oauth2(oauth2).build()`
- **OAuth 1.0a User Context**: `OAuth1` + `XClient.builder().oauth1(oauth1).build()`

## Pagination & Streaming

- Paginated operations have `*Pages(...)` variants returning `Paginator<T>` (implementing `Iterable<T>`) for automatic cursor-based iteration.
- Streaming operations return `EventStream<T>` (implementing `Iterable<T>` and `AutoCloseable`) with incremental UTF-8 line decoding and exponential backoff reconnection.
